;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.622ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 717 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the temperature in Kelvin</li>\n\n<li><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.986ex\" height=\"1.025ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -442 878 453\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is the mass of one molecule of the gas</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Given that the atomic mass of helium is 4 amu and that of argon is 40 amu, we can find the rms speed ratio by comparing the rms speeds of helium and argon, as temperature <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.622ex\" height=\"1.532ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -677 717 677\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D447\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D447\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and Boltzmann constant <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.179ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 521 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D458\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D458\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> are the same for both gases :</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.536ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.872ex\" height=\"4.208ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1181.3 10109.4 1860\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,516.8) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(451,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45A\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1329,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(1839.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(389,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">helium</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3989,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(432.1,-370.3) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\">